sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Creator (Flutter)
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant AI as AI Service
    participant GenAI as Google GenAI
    participant TTS as Gemini TTS
    participant CDB as Content DB
    participant NS as Notification Service

    C->>GW: POST /ai/chat-create/threads
    GW->>GW: Verify JWT
    GW->>AI: Proxy request
    AI->>AI: Create chat_thread
    AI-->>C: thread_id

    C->>GW: POST /threads/{id}/messages
    GW->>AI: Proxy request
    AI->>GenAI: Generate response (Gemini)
    GenAI-->>AI: AI response + production_plan
    AI->>AI: Save chat_message + production_plan
    AI-->>C: message + plan_id

    C->>GW: POST /plans/{id}/create-show
    GW->>AI: Proxy request
    AI->>AI: Create generation_job (show_creation)
    AI-->>C: job_id (queued)

    Note over AI: Background Worker
    AI->>CDB: INSERT show + show_hosts
    AI->>GenAI: Generate script
    AI->>TTS: Generate audio (TTS)
    AI->>AI: Align transcript
    AI->>CDB: INSERT episode + segments + assets
    AI->>AI: Update job status = completed
    AI->>NS: POST /internal/notifications/inbox
    NS-->>AI: 201 Created
